# prometheus API — a minimal NestJS app exposing Prometheus metrics.
# Run `pnpm start:prometheus` first, then send these. GET / increments the
# get_hello_calls counter; GET /metrics exposes it in Prometheus text format.

### 1. GET / — increments get_hello_calls counter
GET http://localhost:3000

### 2. GET /metrics — Prometheus exposition; watch get_hello_calls grow
GET http://localhost:3000/metrics